  "thag1.18:0.4": "Thag 1:18 Siṅgālapitar ",
  "thag1.18:1.1": "There was an heir to the One Awakened, ",
  "thag1.18:1.2": "a monk in the Bhesakaḷā forest, ",
  "thag1.18:1.3": "who suffused this whole earth ",
  "thag1.18:1.4": "with the perception of\n“bones.” ",
  "thag1.18:1.5": "Quickly, I’d say, ",
  "thag1.18:1.6": "he abandoned\nsensual passion. ",
  "thag1.18:1.7": ""
}
